Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.72,0:00:06.96,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,1300,4840,6240)\pos(640,352.667)}Episode 4
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.72,0:00:06.96,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,1300,4840,6240)\pos(640,536.667)}Mengde Presents a Blade
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:40.16,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2040,2400)\pos(317.091,462.364)}Wáng Yǔn\NStyled: Zǐshī
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.46,0:00:43.56,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,At Bohai, Yuan Shao heard that Dong Zhuo was abusing power,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.56,0:00:46.33,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,so he wrote a secret letter to Wang Yun,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.33,0:00:48.83,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,plotting to assassinate Dong Zhuo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.07,0:01:22.34,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, please sit! Please sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.84,0:01:28.32,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Today is my birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.68,0:01:29.20,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(965.818,493.091)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1520,1520)}Cáo Cāo\NStyled: Mèngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.84,0:01:31.02,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Dear guests,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.78,0:01:35.30,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,you are all veteran ministers of the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.17,0:01:39.29,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.91,0:01:40.96,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.66,0:01:56.60,Default,Guest,0,0,0,,Your Excellency, this is your birthday. Why cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.98,0:01:58.06,Default,Officials,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.68,0:02:03.77,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Let me be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.18,0:02:09.80,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Today... is not my birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.17,0:02:14.56,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I only wanted to have a meeting with you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.77,0:02:18.10,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I feared that Dong Zhuo would get suspicious,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.77,0:02:21.11,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}so I made this birthday excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.56,0:02:26.11,Default,Officials,0,0,0,,So that is his real intention...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.11,0:02:26.87,Default,Officials,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.90,0:02:35.00,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Dong Zhuo bullies the Emperor and abuses power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.00,0:02:38.06,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Imperial rule is on the brink of chaos!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.68,0:02:44.11,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Knowing how Emperor Gaozu defeated Qin and Chu,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.11,0:02:46.89,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}thereby taking over the realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.89,0:02:50.38,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}who would have ever thought that now,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.42,0:02:54.31,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}his legacy will fall at the hands of Dong Zhuo?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.10,0:03:27.44,Default,Guest,0,0,0,,Mengde, why are you laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.38,0:03:31.36,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,All the court ministers are here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.36,0:03:34.05,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,crying from dusk to dawn and from dawn to dusk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.05,0:03:37.24,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,But how can crying kill Dong Zhuo?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.46,0:03:38.99,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Cao Mengde!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.54,0:03:43.77,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Your ancestors also enjoyed the bounty of the Han!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.77,0:03:45.34,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Instead of repaying it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.34,0:03:47.00,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,you are laughing at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.55,0:03:49.49,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,What is your reason?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.94,0:03:50.62,Default,Officials,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.89,0:03:57.34,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I am not laughing for the sake of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.96,0:03:59.97,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I am laughing at you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.22,0:04:04.07,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,You do not even have a single plan to kill Dong Zhuo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.12,0:04:08.73,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Do you have a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.98,0:04:12.90,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I may have no talent,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.76,0:04:16.17,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,but I am willing to cut his head off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.53,0:04:18.44,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,And hang it at the capital gates!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.44,0:04:20.15,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,That is how we should apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.07,0:04:36.25,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Mengde, what is your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.43,0:04:44.83,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Come, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.70,0:05:45.48,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Please look.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.63,0:06:09.85,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Benchu wrote this letter with great passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.30,0:06:13.63,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Only...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.35,0:06:15.58,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Only what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.98,0:06:25.22,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Only that he is at Bohai, far away from any danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.49,0:06:32.37,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,It is easy for him to order people to do what he dares not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.33,0:06:35.09,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,What do you suggest?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.01,0:06:38.65,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I can eliminate Dong Zhuo
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.85,0:06:41.46,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,without a single soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.86,0:06:53.68,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I have heard that you possess the Seven Star Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.27,0:06:57.68,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,It can cut hair blown against it\N and it can slice iron like mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.68,0:06:59.33,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,There is nothing as sharp as it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.41,0:07:03.45,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Do you mean to slay the traitor as Wu Fu had tried?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.26,0:07:06.53,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Impossible, impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.94,0:07:08.75,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,You must learn from the past!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.11,0:07:17.84,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Why are you laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.89,0:07:22.64,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,How can assassinating him be as easy as you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.76,0:07:29.10,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,He brings armored bodyguards wherever he goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.10,0:07:31.59,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,His lackey, Lü Bu, also never leaves his side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.51,0:07:33.28,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,How difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.31,0:07:35.64,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,How difficult!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.34,0:07:40.02,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Sir, your concerns are not necessarily wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.02,0:07:42.26,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,but not necessarily right either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.92,0:07:45.68,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.69,0:07:56.24,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Dong Zhuo is brutal, but he is not thorough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.79,0:08:02.03,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Wu Fu tried to kill him, but he failed and lost his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.03,0:08:04.31,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Dong Zhuo killed him as an example,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.31,0:08:06.42,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,so no one has dared kill him like Wu Fu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.48,0:08:09.88,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,However, things are different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.88,0:08:15.29,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,That past failure does not mean I will fail this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.40,0:08:19.38,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,That being said, it is still difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.98,0:08:22.26,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The traitor is constantly wary,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.26,0:08:23.86,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}that much is evident.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.86,0:08:26.00,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}But who is he wary against?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.73,0:08:29.07,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Of course, his enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.70,0:08:32.93,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}In the past, Yao Li assassinated Qingji.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.76,0:08:35.88,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Yao Li was a Wu assassin hired to kill Prince Qingji of Wu during the Spring and Autumn period.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.93,0:08:35.88,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Qingji was stronger than even ten thousand men,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.88,0:08:39.13,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}whereas Yao Li was feeble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.51,0:08:42.04,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}So how could Yao Li have assassinated him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.04,0:08:44.61,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}It was because Qingji had trusted Yao Li!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.20,0:08:52.29,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Right right right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.63,0:08:57.20,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Someone who he trusted was able to slay him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.79,0:09:00.79,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Thus, he never put his guard up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.91,0:09:04.10,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Recently, I have been serving Dong Zhuo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.10,0:09:06.34,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}He places great trust in me,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.79,0:09:09.33,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}consulting me on matters major and minor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.33,0:09:11.18,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I have become so close with him
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.18,0:09:13.74,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}that I can enter his mansion whenever I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.19,0:09:18.79,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Give me your dagger and I shall kill him next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.33,0:09:21.16,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Success will be guaranteed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.69,0:09:39.51,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Mengde, if your heart is set,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.22,0:09:42.99,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,then the empire is blessed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.57,0:09:46.67,Default,Wang Yun,0,0,0,,Please accept my respects!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.73,0:09:58.59,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,August Heaven and Mother Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.59,0:10:01.37,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,your Colonel of Agile Cavalry, Cao Cao,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.37,0:10:03.56,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,will slay the evil traitor Dong Zhuo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.56,0:10:05.21,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Let me save the court and state;
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.21,0:10:07.14,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,let me appease the realm and people!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.14,0:10:10.95,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Through water and fire, I will never falter!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.83,0:10:22.12,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Li Ru, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.85,0:10:27.48,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,Mengde, the Premier of State is in that pavilion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.97,0:10:29.30,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,You may enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.71,0:10:30.35,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.04,0:10:47.62,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.33,0:10:50.43,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.34,0:10:52.60,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.22,0:11:00.70,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Why is the mansion so quiet and empty today?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.13,0:11:04.33,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,The Premier's resting at the \Nsmall pavilion in the garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.33,0:11:06.90,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,The servants have today off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.43,0:11:09.67,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,You'll need to look for him yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.59,0:11:13.32,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Then have some rest as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.13,0:11:37.23,Default,Maid,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.18,0:11:42.90,Default,Maid,0,0,0,,You little critter, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.36,0:12:09.01,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Salutations, Premier.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.08,0:12:13.28,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(962.909,462.545)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1840,2240)}Dǒng Zhuó\NStyled: Zhòngyǐng
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.27,0:12:12.19,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Mengde!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.60,0:12:16.20,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Why are you late today?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.09,0:12:22.19,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,My frail horse was not able to endure the travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.00,0:12:24.28,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,That is why I am late.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.11,0:12:28.73,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me about your horse earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.12,0:12:32.21,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,How can an officer not have a good horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.22,0:12:36.09,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Fengxian!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.22,0:12:40.48,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Go pick a good horse from Xiliang.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.28,0:12:40.92,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(976,466.909)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2320,2680)}Lü Bù\NStyled: Fèngxiān
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.48,0:12:44.29,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,You'll be gifting it to Mengde.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.04,0:12:45.49,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.78,0:12:54.00,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Thank you, Premier!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.22,0:12:56.43,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.20,0:13:10.34,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Your generosity is as grand as a mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.43,0:13:45.19,Thinking,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,This bastard is strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.19,0:13:46.70,Thinking,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I cannot underestimate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.05,0:14:27.87,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Premier.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.74,0:14:33.44,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,I'm a bit tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.30,0:14:35.70,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Please get comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.70,0:14:37.24,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I will watch over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.09,0:15:14.27,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Mengde, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.17,0:15:20.53,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I am presenting this blade with seven jewels to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.90,0:15:30.04,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,A fine blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.71,0:15:37.18,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,This is really a fine blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.47,0:15:39.33,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Fengxian.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.15,0:15:41.07,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.28,0:15:57.29,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Come come come!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.89,0:16:00.29,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Let's see which horse Fengxian chose for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.29,0:16:00.82,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.22,0:16:17.25,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,What a fine horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.53,0:16:20.14,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Indeed, it is a fine horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.76,0:16:19.19,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,A fine horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.16,0:16:38.32,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for this fine horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.32,0:16:40.06,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,This horse is quite spirited.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.06,0:16:41.89,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,You should be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.72,0:16:44.32,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Yes, I will be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.36,0:17:10.06,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.38,0:17:16.98,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,It seemed Cao Cao was about to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.16,0:17:27.16,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,I was also suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.61,0:17:38.38,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,The Premier is in the pavilion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.38,0:17:39.96,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,You may enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.32,0:17:42.04,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(981.818,491.636)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1360,1760)}Lǐ Rú
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.99,0:17:52.93,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.74,0:17:55.81,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,that when you caught him,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.81,0:17:57.36,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,he pretended to present this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.42,0:18:12.24,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,Premier.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.93,0:18:16.82,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,Cao Cao has no family in the capital, he lives by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.64,0:18:20.11,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,We can send someone to summon him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.21,0:18:24.53,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,If he comes, then he was presenting the blade to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.27,0:18:30.10,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,If he does not, then he was trying to assassinate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.03,0:18:38.94,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Send someone to summon him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.45,0:18:47.10,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,Premier!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.89,0:18:49.90,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,Cao Cao did try to assassinate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.31,0:18:55.63,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,He never returned home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.63,0:18:58.67,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,Instead, he rode to the east gate and told the guard
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.67,0:19:01.68,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,that he had an urgent mission from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.68,0:19:03.83,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,He then rode out of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.43,0:19:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I valued him...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.28,0:19:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,... yet he wishes to harm me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.39,0:19:20.29,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,Premier.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.94,0:19:24.80,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,There may be accomplices to this plot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.50,0:19:26.25,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Accomplices?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.03,0:19:32.94,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Arrest this traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.80,0:19:34.99,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Find any accomplices!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.31,0:19:35.96,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,As you wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.37,0:19:39.38,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,Premier,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.38,0:19:43.45,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,get his likeness drawn and show it everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.61,0:19:57.20,Default,Guards,0,0,0,,Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.56,0:20:16.36,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Want to ride the horse, my child?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.12,0:20:18.28,Default,Peasant,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, get on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.26,0:20:28.01,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Nice, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.77,0:20:30.40,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Uncle, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.06,0:20:34.65,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Sit straight. Do not move.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.27,0:20:43.78,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Uncle, that's you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.90,0:20:45.87,Default,Guards,0,0,0,,Arrest him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.70,0:20:48.12,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Why are you arresting me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.05,0:20:51.84,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,You have the wrong man!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.13,0:20:59.97,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,You have the wrong man!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.97,0:21:00.37,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.48,0:21:01.33,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.18,0:21:03.39,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,You have this wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.08,0:21:26.78,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I am just a merchant passing by!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.78,0:21:28.76,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,My surname is Huangfu. Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.52,0:21:49.04,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(970.182,482.909)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2200,2560)}Chén Gōng\NStyled: Gōngtái
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.80,0:22:00.97,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Hurry up and let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.00,0:22:17.98,Thinking,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,To hand him over and be rewarded,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.19,0:22:20.65,Thinking,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,or to let him go?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.61,0:22:23.80,Thinking,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,If I hand him over to Dong Zhuo,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.80,0:22:25.74,Thinking,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,the realm will curse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.54,0:22:28.95,Thinking,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,If I release him, my career will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.97,0:22:44.72,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,You do...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.82,0:22:47.99,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,bear a resemblance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.91,0:22:51.10,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Correct, correct!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.10,0:22:53.29,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,But many people resemble each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.29,0:22:55.78,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I do not blame you for arresting me by mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.78,0:22:56.72,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Just let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.32,0:23:02.44,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,For the time being, imprison him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.86,0:23:08.22,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,You have the wrong man!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.68,0:23:10.24,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,You have the wrong man!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.24,0:23:11.81,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Hurry up and let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.81,0:23:13.34,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.08,0:23:15.94,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Hurry up and let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.94,0:23:17.64,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.64,0:23:18.34,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.34,0:23:20.09,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,You have the wrong man!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.09,0:23:21.36,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.36,0:23:21.79,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.79,0:23:23.42,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.42,0:23:23.92,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.92,0:23:25.63,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,You have the wrong man!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.63,0:23:25.97,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.97,0:23:26.82,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,The wrong man!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.82,0:23:28.20,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Hurry up and let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.80,0:24:34.46,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,Cao Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.44,0:24:44.74,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,You must be mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.44,0:24:46.82,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,My surname is Huangfu.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.25,0:24:51.08,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,Do you have to hide your identity?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.46,0:24:54.28,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,When I went to Luoyang to seek office in the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.28,0:24:56.23,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,I happened to meet you, Cao Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.95,0:25:18.29,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,I heard that the Premier treated you well.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.85,0:25:22.08,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,Why did you invite trouble onto yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.43,0:25:30.79,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}How can a sparrow grasp the aspirations of a swan?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.11,0:25:35.70,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}You see yourself as a swan,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.70,0:25:37.84,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}but how can you know who the sparrows are?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.84,0:25:39.07,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Stop blabbering!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.07,0:25:41.67,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,You have me, so hand me over and claim your prize!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.67,0:25:43.00,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,How did you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.00,0:25:46.54,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Heaps of gold and thousands of households! Are they not enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.60,0:25:57.64,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,To a lowly prefect like me, those heaps of gold are truly considerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.04,0:26:01.40,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,Having that many households is beyond my dreams also.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.79,0:26:12.00,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,However, I could have sent you to the capital earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.00,0:26:13.69,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,and be rewarded for my service.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.02,0:26:18.57,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,So why did I imprison you for the time being,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.42,0:26:22.21,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,not revealing your identity?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.90,0:26:29.75,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Are you going to release me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.29,0:26:33.70,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,How can you be so sure that I will release you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.82,0:26:36.88,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Then what are you going to do to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.59,0:26:50.56,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,I ask you,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.43,0:26:55.38,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,the Premier valued you, but you tried to assassinate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.14,0:26:58.66,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,There must be a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.96,0:27:05.83,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}My family was fed by the Han Empire for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.83,0:27:10.08,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}If I do not repay the nation, \Nhow would I differ from a beast?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.56,0:27:16.21,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The reason I bowed down to Dong Zhuo
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.21,0:27:18.36,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}was to find a chance to kill the bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.98,0:27:21.77,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Never did I expect to fail, my efforts for naught.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.04,0:27:24.96,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Perhaps this is the will of Heaven...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.45,0:27:29.70,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}So where will you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.21,0:27:33.85,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I will return to my hometown and forge an edict,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.29,0:27:37.16,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}telling every lord in the realm to fight Dong Zhuo!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.74,0:27:39.04,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}To fight Dong Zhuo?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.77,0:27:42.36,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}To fight Dong Zhuo and to revive the Han!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.57,0:27:59.37,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,Please sit and accept my respects!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.37,0:28:01.98,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,Your prisoner does not dare receive such honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.88,0:28:05.82,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,Please sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.82,0:28:07.31,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I dare not sit before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.40,0:28:12.02,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.34,0:28:20.53,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,I do not know where your hometown is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.20,0:28:23.82,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,My father and family live in Dong Commandery.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.74,0:28:27.37,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,My wife and children also reside there!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.72,0:28:30.75,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,So that makes us fellow townsmen!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.71,0:28:33.47,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,May I ask your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.88,0:28:36.39,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,I am Chen Gong, styled Gongtai.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.81,0:28:40.64,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,After you return, how will you rally the lords?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.11,0:28:56.01,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}When the realm falls into chaos, they will rise up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.76,0:28:58.20,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}After I return home,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.20,0:29:02.14,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I will use all my family wealth to conscript an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.86,0:29:09.80,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I am friends with Yuan Shao, who is in Ji Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.80,0:29:11.85,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}His clan has been top nobles for ages,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.85,0:29:14.92,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}and they have powerful allies throughout the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.92,0:29:19.22,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I will work with him to make a public announcement,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.22,0:29:22.68,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}asking all lords to fight Dong Zhuo and save the Han!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.68,0:29:25.12,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I am sure they will respond with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.92,0:29:27.08,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.38,0:29:56.68,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Dong Zhuo runs amok, harming the state and people.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.68,0:29:58.63,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}All under Heaven want him dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.42,0:30:02.08,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Sir, you are following the Heavens and the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.08,0:30:07.00,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}You will surely succeed in your great cause!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.00,0:30:08.59,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,But right now, I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.64,0:30:15.10,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,Did you think I would hand you over for a reward?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.10,0:30:19.85,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,I, Chen Gong, am no petty official,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.41,0:30:22.63,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,but I have never met a worthy master.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.93,0:30:27.44,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,I am deeply moved by your loyalty \Ntowards the nation and the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.72,0:30:30.34,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,I shall resign my duty as the county magistrate,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.44,0:30:33.57,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,and help you with your great cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.34,0:31:05.06,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Gongtai?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.28,0:31:08.68,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,A man named Lü Boshe lives there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.08,0:31:11.14,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,He is the sworn brother of my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.49,0:31:14.51,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,How does resting here for the night sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.51,0:31:16.20,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I can get news on my family, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.01,0:31:19.81,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,If he is the sworn brother of your father, then alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.81,0:31:20.33,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,Let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.58,0:31:39.29,Default,Household Guy,0,0,0,,Who're you looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.42,0:31:41.96,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Is your host home?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.73,0:31:43.25,Default,Household Guy,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.09,0:31:46.05,Default,Household Guy,0,0,0,,Master, there's someone here to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.48,0:31:50.32,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(910,270.545)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1520,1840)}Lǚ Bóshē
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.38,0:31:51.76,Default,Lü Boshe,0,0,0,,You are...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.96,0:31:53.58,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Uncle,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.69,0:31:55.97,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I am Aman.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.69,0:31:56.40,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Aman was Cao Cao's childhood name.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.92,0:31:58.84,Default,Lü Boshe,0,0,0,,Aman!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.06,0:32:00.99,Default,Lü Boshe,0,0,0,,Please come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.59,0:32:02.21,Default,Lü Boshe,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.36,0:32:05.26,Default,Lü Boshe,0,0,0,,Come in, hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.61,0:32:06.36,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.22,0:32:13.76,Default,Lü Boshe,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.76,0:32:14.54,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,After you, uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.54,0:32:15.40,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,After you, Gongtai.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.60,0:32:22.60,Default,Lü Boshe,0,0,0,,Aman.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.73,0:32:25.97,Default,Lü Boshe,0,0,0,,I heard...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.48,0:32:27.31,Default,Lü Boshe,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.72,0:32:31.73,Default,Lü Boshe,0,0,0,,I heard that the court was looking everywhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.96,0:32:34.27,Default,Lü Boshe,0,0,0,,to arrest you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.72,0:32:38.87,Default,Lü Boshe,0,0,0,,Why did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.70,0:32:43.36,Default,Lü Boshe,0,0,0,,Why did you come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.51,0:32:47.06,Default,Lü Boshe,0,0,0,,Your father has already taken refuge at Chenliu.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.21,0:32:54.77,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,It is hard to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.14,0:33:07.49,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I failed to assassinate Dong Zhuo, so I fled the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.44,0:33:11.97,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I ran until I was arrested at Zhongmou county.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.69,0:33:16.71,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,If Prefect Chen did not leave \Nhis post to escape with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.19,0:33:20.56,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,your nephew would have been dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.68,0:33:30.21,Default,Lü Boshe,0,0,0,,Without you, the entire Cao clan would be dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.10,0:33:35.77,Default,Lü Boshe,0,0,0,,Please take a seat and rest here for the night!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.77,0:33:37.16,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother you, uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.44,0:33:40.36,Default,Lü Boshe,0,0,0,,Rest, you two. I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.36,0:33:40.88,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.88,0:33:53.54,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.85,0:34:09.14,Default,Lü Boshe,0,0,0,,I don't have good wine at my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.14,0:34:11.66,Default,Lü Boshe,0,0,0,,I'll go to the village and purchase some for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.66,0:34:13.06,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,Thank you, uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.10,0:34:18.73,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,We can sleep in peace here tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.72,0:34:43.43,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Gongtai.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.96,0:34:44.52,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Gongtai?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.62,0:34:47.20,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Hear that? What is that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.09,0:34:55.46,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Lü Boshe is not a close relative of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.33,0:34:58.99,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,He left in a hurry and is still not back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.29,0:35:00.58,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,This is too suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.46,0:35:21.48,Default,Sharpener,0,0,0,,Sharpen it more.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.85,0:35:22.73,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.73,0:35:24.55,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,We will die if we do not act!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.55,0:35:39.69,Default,Woman,0,0,0,,Murderer!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.96,0:35:51.12,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.39,0:36:02.02,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.45,0:36:03.95,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.08,0:36:16.05,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,Your uncle wanted to kill this pig to treat us!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.01,0:36:21.76,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,We killed good people, for nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.28,0:36:44.83,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,What is done is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.56,0:36:47.14,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,There is no point for regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.64,0:36:49.09,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,We have to flee!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.78,0:37:04.56,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,So he really went off to buy wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.90,0:37:11.92,Default,Lü Boshe,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, why are you leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.23,0:37:16.04,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,As a criminal, I do not dare overstay my welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.19,0:37:22.14,Default,Lü Boshe,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, wait! Please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.14,0:37:24.71,Default,Lü Boshe,0,0,0,,I already told my family to slaughter a pig for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.71,0:37:28.24,Default,Lü Boshe,0,0,0,,Why not rest at my humble abode for the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.70,0:37:30.40,Default,Lü Boshe,0,0,0,,Please turn around!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.36,0:37:33.13,Default,Lü Boshe,0,0,0,,Please come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.00,0:37:37.18,Default,Lü Boshe,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.79,0:37:51.92,Default,Lü Boshe,0,0,0,,Nephew, what's that on your body?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.92,0:37:52.70,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.63,0:37:55.59,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Look at that person behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.33,0:38:06.66,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,You killed by mistake just a while back.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.66,0:38:08.56,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,What is this now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.17,0:38:12.58,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,If Boshe returned home,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.37,0:38:16.00,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,would he let the murder of his family go?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.72,0:38:18.18,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,He would lead men after us,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.55,0:38:21.01,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,dooming us two.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.12,0:38:22.97,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,Uncle...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.58,0:38:25.67,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,Uncle...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.55,0:38:26.89,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,Uncle...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.89,0:38:28.33,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,He's already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.00,0:38:30.58,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Crying won't make a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.95,0:38:31.47,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.22,0:38:34.28,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,You murdered him!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.28,0:38:36.44,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.44,0:38:38.48,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,You have gone too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.07,0:39:00.74,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Rather I betray the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.12,0:39:05.72,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}than let the world betray me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.32,0:39:21.00,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,Until now, I followed him for the nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.00,0:39:23.06,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,For that, I cannot kill him,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.06,0:39:24.76,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,but I will not stand with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.20,0:39:29.45,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,I will leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.22,0:39:32.24,Default,Chen Gong,0,0,0,,You go ahead with your "great cause."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.76,0:40:00.37,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Cao Cao went back to Chenliu.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.37,0:40:03.94,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,He spent all his family wealth to recruit an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.77,0:40:10.46,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,He contacted Yuan Shao to send out \Ndeclarations everywhere to fight Dong Zhuo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.46,0:40:14.38,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,They were answered all across the world.

